                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Tenth badge earned, and here you are back at the caldera gate. Pyroclast guards the mouth of Scorchspire for the ones who keep coming - the Descent is your forge now, and I am its last hammer."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Darmanitan does not cool down between champions. Descend the whole gauntlet and finish on me any time your team wants the fire. The gate never closes to a real challenger."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Karn - the caldera gate stays open to fire",
                    Label: "rematch_ready"
