                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The caldera gate. I am the last thing on the Cinderfall Descent, and the Fire gym is one lava bridge past me - I let nobody through half-forged. You lit up the moment you reached the mouth. Everything you have, on the hot stone, now."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My whole team is fire and none of it flinches. The Descent is meant to burn the last runs down before Scorchspire ever gets the satisfaction. Show me it will not burn you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You carry the founder-face, and this close to the summit I will finally say it out loud: some of us stoked our forges hoping you were real. Prove it against my strongest, or turn back and stay a cinder in a story."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Karn Pyroclast",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
